# LongReadX checksums
#
# SHA256 checksums for frozen biological inputs should be generated locally
# after final input acquisition.
#
# Large biological input files are intentionally not distributed through
# GitHub.
#
# Example:
#
# sha256sum data/raw/HG002_HiFi_chr20_20M_40M.fastq.gz
# sha256sum data/reference/GRCh38_chr20.fa
# sha256sum data/truth/HG002_GRCh38_v5.0q_stvar.vcf.gz
